sequenceDiagram
    actor Client
    participant WebServer as Web Server
    participant AuthService as Auth Service
    participant Database

    Client->>WebServer: POST /login (username, password)
    WebServer->>AuthService: validateCredentials(username, password)
    AuthService->>Database: SELECT user WHERE username = ?
    Database-->>AuthService: user record
    AuthService->>AuthService: verify password hash
    alt credentials valid
        AuthService-->>WebServer: auth token
        WebServer-->>Client: 200 OK + session token
    else credentials invalid
        AuthService-->>WebServer: authentication failed
        WebServer-->>Client: 401 Unauthorized
    end
